  "title": "利用可显进度的一键dd脚本1keydd重装osx为带gui的pve",
  "subtitle": "",
  "icon": "📄",
  "tags": [
    "文档"
  ],
  "category": "instnews",
  "lastUpdated": "2024-01-30",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "第一步，下载面的脚本依赖，将osx打造为脚本友好的环境（实际上就是grub2）：",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "https://github.com/minlearn/inst/releases/download/inital/instsupportforosx.pkg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        "在你要dd的osx上解压依赖并安装，确保你能成功执行wget和grub命令（比如grub-mkimage）",
        "对了osx下需要进入恢复模式打开csrutil disable",
        "一切完成后，在bash中执行："
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "bash",
      "content": "wget -qO- inst.sh|bash -s - -t debianmu\n大部分参数和在linux下一样，除了不推荐使用-n参数"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        "debianmu新加了一个gui桌面模式，与console的pve做成了二合一的pve发布版：",
        "脚本执行完后选择grub条目启动，dd完后选择devdeskos gui启动。",
        "完工！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "hr"
    },
